2026-10-10  Ole Kristian Aamot  <ole.aamot@aamotinnovation.com>

	* Release 8.0.0.

	* configure.ac, Makefile.am, autogen.sh: GNU Autotools build with
	dist-xz, distcheck and unit tests.
	* src/gj-project.[ch]: Project model and GJXML reader/writer.
	* src/gj-engine.[ch]: GStreamer playback, overdub recording and
	WAV mixdown export with live mix updates.
	* src/gj-waveform.[ch]: WAV peak reader and timeline widget.
	* src/gj-window.[ch]: libadwaita main window, track rows,
	transport, meters, file dialogs.
	* src/main.c: AdwApplication, actions, accelerators, about dialog,
	headless --export-mixdown.
	* data/: desktop file, AppStream metainfo, MIME type, icons,
	man page.
	* tests/: GJXML and WAV peak tests.
	* doc/gjxml.md: GarageJam XML project format.
